+# Transport compression codec
+
+No current decision is recorded for a transport compression codec: Muninn ships
+as a local, server-less binary with no network transport in its read or write
+path, so no codec choice exists in the project's recorded decisions
+(`research/CONCLUSION.md`, `research/00-evidence-log.md`, `design/ENGINE.md`).
